            "review_title": "Review at Grill Riverside Restaurant",
            "review_text": "omega7326\nFrisco, Texas14 contributions\n0\nGreat service - average food - not cheap\nJun 2016 • Couples\nThis is a restaurant you want to go to with four or more people. The serving sizes are a little large and therefore I can get very pricey for just two people. The quality of the food is average to above-average me. Service is superb with several servers all ready and willing to help.\nWritten June 30, 2016",
